{"id":71320,"date":"2026-10-29T19:23:11","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:23:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71320"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:24:32","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:24:32","slug":"pinheiro-grande-backyard-ultra-gdpg","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pinheiro-grande-backyard-ultra-gdpg\/","title":{"rendered":"Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>3 de Abril de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com primeira partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> no <strong>Campo de Futebol do Pinheiro Grande \u2013 Cabe\u00e7as<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Pinheiro Grande<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Chamusca<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Oficialmente integrada no calend\u00e1rio internacional Backyard Ultra idealizado por Lazarus Lake, a prova desafia os atletas num formato de resist\u00eancia pura em cora\u00e7\u00e3o ribatejano.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o decorre num circuito circular de <strong>6,706 km<\/strong> com cerca de <strong>100 m D+<\/strong> por volta, maioritariamente em estrad\u00e3o e trilhos de terra batida, onde a cada hora exata soa o sino no Curral para uma nova volta com limite estrito de <strong>60 minutos<\/strong> at\u00e9 restar apenas um corredor em prova. Paralelamente \u00e0 prova principal <strong>Backyard Ultra<\/strong> (ilimitada), realizam-se duas variantes aut\u00f3nomas para quem pretende estrear-se no formato: <strong>Backyard 6 Voltas (40,236 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Backyard 3 Voltas (20,118 km)<\/strong>. O evento garante \u00e1rea de assist\u00eancia para tendas e equipas de apoio, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos, seguro desportivo e kit com t-shirt (e sweatshirt na dist\u00e2ncia Ultra).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo do Pinheiro Grande (GDPG)<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio da Chamusca<\/strong> e da <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Chamusca e Pinheiro Grande<\/strong>, a prova distingue o Vencedor, o Assistente, os melhores atletas masculino e feminino e a melhor equipa (soma dos 3 atletas com mais voltas) na Backyard Ultra, bem como os 3 mais r\u00e1pidos M\/F na \u00faltima volta das variantes de 3 e 6 voltas. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo de Futebol do Pinheiro Grande \u2013 Cabe\u00e7as, Pinheiro Grande, Chamusca, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(2