Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Backyard 6 Voltas (40,236 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 600m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29\/03\/2027 (inclui T-shirt))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Backyard 3 Voltas (20,118 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 300m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29\/03\/2027 (inclui T-shirt))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 3 de Abril de 2027, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 no Campo de Futebol do Pinheiro Grande \u2013 Cabe\u00e7as, em Pinheiro Grande, no concelho da Chamusca, distrito de Santar\u00e9m. O secretariado funciona na sexta-feira (02\/04) das 18:00 \u00e0s 22:00 e no s\u00e1bado das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato Backyard Ultra e quais s\u00e3o as variantes dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Seguindo as Backyard Ultra Official Rules, os atletas percorrem um loop circular de 6,706 km (~100 m D+ em estrad\u00e3o e trilhos) com partida a cada hora exata, vencendo o \u00faltimo corredor a completar sozinho uma volta em menos de 60 minutos. Paralelamente, disputam-se as variantes aut\u00f3nomas Backyard 6 Voltas (40,236 km, +18 anos) e Backyard 3 Voltas (20,118 km, +16 anos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 50,00 \u20ac na Backyard Ultra (inclui T-shirt e Sweatshirt), 20,00 \u20ac na Backyard 6 Voltas (inclui T-shirt) e 15,00 \u20ac na Backyard 3 Voltas (inclui T-shirt), com pagamentos at\u00e9 29 de mar\u00e7o de 2027. Todas as modalidades incluem dorsal personalizado, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, zona de apoio, banhos e seguro desportivo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que equipamento \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio ou proibido durante a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Durante os per\u00edodos noturnos \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal dianteira (e aconselh\u00e1vel luz vermelha traseira e telem\u00f3vel). \u00c9 expressamente proibida a utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o de bast\u00f5es, bengalas ou qualquer apoio mec\u00e2nico \u00e0 progress\u00e3o, bem como ajuda externa fora da \u00e1rea de assist\u00eancia.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora da Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Grupo Desportivo do Pinheiro Grande (GDPG), com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio da Chamusca e da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Chamusca e Pinheiro Grande.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Campo de Futebol do Pinheiro Grande \u2013 Cabe\u00e7as, Pinheiro Grande, Chamusca\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Chamusca\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Pinheiro Grande Backyard Ultra \u2013 GDPG 2027 realiza-se a 3 de abril na Chamusca, Santar\u00e9m. Loops de 6,706 km\/h, 3 e 6 voltas. Consulta o guia e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-pinheiro-grande-backyard-ultra-gdpg.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Backyard Ultra (Loops de 6,706 km\/h)\", \"price\": \"50.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4493\/info\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Backyard 6 Voltas (40,236 km)\", \"price\": \"20